cali_01KAJTV791CWMW6A91V1J1M29F	cart_01KAJTV78KY8H8NJZKMJ4GARPP	MATCHA LATTE	Main	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763709505288-cof%201.png	1	variant_01KAJ873NSJ14D77650BKF22S1	prod_01KAJ873AJ4QWWGF51KQGQHAFN	MATCHA LATTE	Uncover the smooth elegance of our Barrio Decaf, a medium roast crafted for those who desire the rich essence of coffee without the caffeine. This blend is a delicate balance of flavors, with a hint of sweetness that provides a satisfying and delightful experience, any time of the day or night.	LATTE	\N	Thirsty	matcha-latte	\N	\N	Main	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	1190000	{"value": "1190000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-21 09:10:09.959+00	2025-11-21 09:10:09.959+00	\N	\N	f	f
cali_01KAK9DQ419S37HTP7K3DBA53W	cart_01KAK9DQ3ZV9QXSGYKME34XC9W	POMELO BLOSSOM	Trial	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763710864916-cof%201.png	1	variant_01KAJ873NVTCSQNJ9RKY4CA9GN	prod_01KAJ873AJNYE6C6GW5G1DET9T	POMELO BLOSSOM	In Vietnamese culture, pomelo blossom is among the rare flowers to be savored both as scent and flavor. It sweetens syrups, desserts like chè, and traditional dishes as a uniquely aromatic ingredient. Grandmothers and mothers would steep the blossoms for hair and bath-water, a gentle fragrance threading through hair and skin-binding childhood memories to bloom. Quietly, pomelo blossom has lived in our daily rituals, imprinting sight, smell, and taste across generations.\n\nPomelo Blossom Sorbet is KIRA’s tribute to that beauty: a quintessential white-floral accord that’s unsyrupy and not overtly girlish-cool, sheer, and crystalline, like an early-summer morning when clusters of blossoms have just opened, their scent drifting across the veranda.\n\nThrough Pomelo Blossom Sorbet, we hope to share the memory of a beloved flowering season deeply rooted in Vietnamese culture. It is also a creation for white-floral devotees seeking a novel, refreshing facet in their colorful fragrance journey.	BLOSSOM	\N	Icy	pomelo-blossom-sorbet	\N	\N	Trial	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	49000	{"value": "49000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-21 13:24:56.066+00	2025-11-21 13:24:56.066+00	\N	\N	f	f
cali_01KASWB123MYENFJ8D3RAXWZPE	cart_01KASWB121ZNJGMY639NY2AYXS	COFFEELING	Main	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763706198206-mv2.png	1	variant_01KAJGJSRE07J84715QXZND5CN	prod_01KAJ873ACG446Z1942XBJ4EAB	COFFEELING	Memory:\n\nBrings you to a cozy café on a sun-drenched morning. The scent blends rich, freshly brewed coffee with a hint of creamy vanilla and warm spices. It evokes the memory of holding a hot cup, feeling the steam on your face, and watching the world pass by outside the window. With each inhale, it’s like reliving those peaceful moments of comfort and warmth, wrapped in the aroma of roasted beans.	COFFEE	\N	Thirsty	coffeeling	\N	\N	Main	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	1190000	{"value": "1190000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-24 02:50:57.477+00	2025-11-24 02:50:57.477+00	\N	\N	f	f
