cali_01KATCER5D9028RFJZAB9EX5HS	cart_01KATCER566B2EG04JFSXWE91N	SUBLIME SAFFRON	Main	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763711055825-219b71_f5263180c9b34f30992a6ececef30bf7~mv2.png	12	variant_01KAJ873NW2S45ZN5KZE57AKZS	prod_01KAJ873AJH2QK1E83XTE2CDHX	SUBLIME SAFFRON	Globally, saffron is revered as a precious spice-coded red, warm, and glowing. Yet within saffron lies a dormant, cool edge. In this creation, KIRA draws out that hidden facet to reveal an entirely different olfactory experience-our boldest challenge and milestone in building the ICY collection.\n\nThe idea is inspired by bastani sonnati, Iran’s traditional saffron ice cream, where the warm, spicy glow of saffron threads is softened by chilled, silky cream. This hot-cold interplay not only makes the scent distinctive, it also develops uniquely on skin: some perceive a gentle warmth beneath the initial chill; others experience pure, crystalline coolness. Common to all is the immediate sensation of freshness and ease from the very first spray.\n\nSublime Saffron Sorbet is layered yet composed-refined with the character-versatile for everyday wear without fatigue. It’s especially suited to office environments: pleasant, with commendable sillage and persistence, yet never overpowering.	SAFFRON	\N	Icy	sublime-saffron-sorbet	\N	\N	Main	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	1190000	{"value": "1190000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-24 07:32:36.657+00	2025-11-24 07:33:23.898+00	2025-11-24 07:33:23.896+00	\N	f	f
