cali_01KATDMCEB33AK51PHPET4C8N6	cart_01KATCER566B2EG04JFSXWE91N	POMELO BLOSSOM	Trial	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763710864916-cof%201.png	1	variant_01KAJ873NVTCSQNJ9RKY4CA9GN	prod_01KAJ873AJNYE6C6GW5G1DET9T	POMELO BLOSSOM	In Vietnamese culture, pomelo blossom is among the rare flowers to be savored both as scent and flavor. It sweetens syrups, desserts like chè, and traditional dishes as a uniquely aromatic ingredient. Grandmothers and mothers would steep the blossoms for hair and bath-water, a gentle fragrance threading through hair and skin-binding childhood memories to bloom. Quietly, pomelo blossom has lived in our daily rituals, imprinting sight, smell, and taste across generations.\n\nPomelo Blossom Sorbet is KIRA’s tribute to that beauty: a quintessential white-floral accord that’s unsyrupy and not overtly girlish-cool, sheer, and crystalline, like an early-summer morning when clusters of blossoms have just opened, their scent drifting across the veranda.\n\nThrough Pomelo Blossom Sorbet, we hope to share the memory of a beloved flowering season deeply rooted in Vietnamese culture. It is also a creation for white-floral devotees seeking a novel, refreshing facet in their colorful fragrance journey.	BLOSSOM	\N	Icy	pomelo-blossom-sorbet	\N	\N	Trial	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	49000	{"value": "49000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-24 07:53:09.835+00	2025-11-24 07:57:17.154+00	2025-11-24 07:57:17.153+00	\N	f	f
