ordli_01KAT3D0V7VM4X2YP84Q75JZW6	\N	ZESTY HAZE	Trial	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763711239101-cof%201.png	variant_01KAJ873NXB63X71DCPAMQM4X6	prod_01KAJ873AJH7RBS5FNG773D1AA	ZESTY HAZE	Zesty Haze Sorbet opens on a bracing, frosted citrus field - grapefruits and lemons sparkling like early sunlight. Imagine gently squeezing a fresh orange segment: the essential oils mist into the air with crystalline clarity, both cooling and awakening the senses. Zesty Haze Sorbet bottles that precise moment on skin, setting the tone for a day that begins alert and refreshed.\n\nTrue to the citrus family-bright, vivid, luminous, and clean-Zesty Haze Sorbet doesn’t fizzle out like many classic citrus colognes. A velvety musky base anchors the composition, giving it excellent longevity on skin. As it interacts with your body, the diffusion flexes with temperature-sometimes intimate, sometimes more expansive.\n\nAn ideal choice to kick-start a high-energy morning, power you through a workout, or refresh you anytime you crave a cool pocket of air in the tropical heat.	HAZE	\N	Icy	zesty-haze-sorbe	\N	\N	Trial	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	49000	{"value": "49000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-24 04:54:22.826+00	2025-11-24 04:54:22.826+00	\N	f	\N	f
ordli_01KATB9JG3Y0FAEVWXNJAXCB8M	\N	POMELO BLOSSOM	Trial	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763710864916-cof%201.png	variant_01KAJ873NVTCSQNJ9RKY4CA9GN	prod_01KAJ873AJNYE6C6GW5G1DET9T	POMELO BLOSSOM	In Vietnamese culture, pomelo blossom is among the rare flowers to be savored both as scent and flavor. It sweetens syrups, desserts like chè, and traditional dishes as a uniquely aromatic ingredient. Grandmothers and mothers would steep the blossoms for hair and bath-water, a gentle fragrance threading through hair and skin-binding childhood memories to bloom. Quietly, pomelo blossom has lived in our daily rituals, imprinting sight, smell, and taste across generations.\n\nPomelo Blossom Sorbet is KIRA’s tribute to that beauty: a quintessential white-floral accord that’s unsyrupy and not overtly girlish-cool, sheer, and crystalline, like an early-summer morning when clusters of blossoms have just opened, their scent drifting across the veranda.\n\nThrough Pomelo Blossom Sorbet, we hope to share the memory of a beloved flowering season deeply rooted in Vietnamese culture. It is also a creation for white-floral devotees seeking a novel, refreshing facet in their colorful fragrance journey.	BLOSSOM	\N	Icy	pomelo-blossom-sorbet	\N	\N	Trial	\N	t	t	f	\N	\N	49000	{"value": "49000", "precision": 20}	{}	2025-11-24 07:12:18.44+00	2025-11-24 07:12:18.44+00	\N	f	\N	f
