prod_01KAJ873AJAVFJ32YZSM6TV68Q	Sunrise Single-Origin - Light Roast	sunrise-single-origin-light-roast	\N	Embrace the dawn with our Sunrise Single-Origin, a light roast that celebrates the unique terroir of its beans. This coffee is a vibrant expression of bright, floral notes and a subtle sweetness, offering a refreshing and invigorating experience that is ideal for starting your day or enjoying a serene afternoon.	f	published	https://lambdacurrysites.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/barrio/Sunrise-Single.jpg	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VYFXR6AK0A0QNQT5C1	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 06:08:21.267+00	2025-11-21 06:08:21.264+00	\N
prod_01KAJ873ACG446Z1942XBJ4EAB	COFFEELING	coffeeling	COFFEE	Memory:\n\nBrings you to a cozy café on a sun-drenched morning. The scent blends rich, freshly brewed coffee with a hint of creamy vanilla and warm spices. It evokes the memory of holding a hot cup, feeling the steam on your face, and watching the world pass by outside the window. With each inhale, it’s like reliving those peaceful moments of comfort and warmth, wrapped in the aroma of roasted beans.	f	published	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763709089876-cof%201-1.png	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VY4NXQTWB7RA0QKND4	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.207+00	2025-11-24 10:34:16.232+00	\N	{"notes": "<p>Test</p>", "ingredients": "<p>Test</p>", "application_tips": "<p>Test </p>", "precautions_of_use": "<p>Test</p>"}
prod_01KAJ873AJ0HADYQFVSYQM42WM	RICE MILK	rice-mill	RICE	Memory:\n\nCaptures the warmth of mama kitchen where sweet, milky rice simmers on the stove. The scent is gentle and creamy, blending the delicate aroma of steamed rice with a touch of milk. It brings back memories of cozy mornings, the comfort of a warm bowl cradled in your hands, and the soft, soothing sweetness that lingers in the air, like being held in our mother’s arms.	f	published	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763708749969-cof%202.png	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VY4NXQTWB7RA0QKND4	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 07:05:50.102+00	\N	\N
prod_01KAJ873AJ4QWWGF51KQGQHAFN	MATCHA LATTE	matcha-latte	LATTE	Uncover the smooth elegance of our Barrio Decaf, a medium roast crafted for those who desire the rich essence of coffee without the caffeine. This blend is a delicate balance of flavors, with a hint of sweetness that provides a satisfying and delightful experience, any time of the day or night.	f	published	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763709505288-cof%201.png	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VY4NXQTWB7RA0QKND4	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 07:18:25.426+00	\N	\N
prod_01KAJ873AHMTHQHPJ4PXAQZ5M8	Midnight Dark - Dark Roast	midnight-dark-roast	\N	Awaken your senses with the Midnight Dark blend, a bold and luxurious dark roast that captivates with its deep, intense flavors. This coffee is a testament to meticulous roasting, offering a velvety texture and a lingering sweetness that envelops the palate, perfect for those who savor a robust and full-bodied cup.	f	published	https://lambdacurrysites.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/barrio/Midnight-Dark-Roast.jpg	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VYKE57F2G6J62R7CG5	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 07:39:03.404+00	2025-11-21 07:39:03.403+00	\N
prod_01KAJ873AJH2QK1E83XTE2CDHX	SUBLIME SAFFRON	sublime-saffron-sorbet	SAFFRON	Globally, saffron is revered as a precious spice-coded red, warm, and glowing. Yet within saffron lies a dormant, cool edge. In this creation, KIRA draws out that hidden facet to reveal an entirely different olfactory experience-our boldest challenge and milestone in building the ICY collection.\n\nThe idea is inspired by bastani sonnati, Iran’s traditional saffron ice cream, where the warm, spicy glow of saffron threads is softened by chilled, silky cream. This hot-cold interplay not only makes the scent distinctive, it also develops uniquely on skin: some perceive a gentle warmth beneath the initial chill; others experience pure, crystalline coolness. Common to all is the immediate sensation of freshness and ease from the very first spray.\n\nSublime Saffron Sorbet is layered yet composed-refined with the character-versatile for everyday wear without fatigue. It’s especially suited to office environments: pleasant, with commendable sillage and persistence, yet never overpowering.	f	published	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763711055825-219b71_f5263180c9b34f30992a6ececef30bf7~mv2.png	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VYKE57F2G6J62R7CG5	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 07:50:58.837+00	\N	\N
prod_01KAJ873AJNYE6C6GW5G1DET9T	POMELO BLOSSOM	pomelo-blossom-sorbet	BLOSSOM	In Vietnamese culture, pomelo blossom is among the rare flowers to be savored both as scent and flavor. It sweetens syrups, desserts like chè, and traditional dishes as a uniquely aromatic ingredient. Grandmothers and mothers would steep the blossoms for hair and bath-water, a gentle fragrance threading through hair and skin-binding childhood memories to bloom. Quietly, pomelo blossom has lived in our daily rituals, imprinting sight, smell, and taste across generations.\n\nPomelo Blossom Sorbet is KIRA’s tribute to that beauty: a quintessential white-floral accord that’s unsyrupy and not overtly girlish-cool, sheer, and crystalline, like an early-summer morning when clusters of blossoms have just opened, their scent drifting across the veranda.\n\nThrough Pomelo Blossom Sorbet, we hope to share the memory of a beloved flowering season deeply rooted in Vietnamese culture. It is also a creation for white-floral devotees seeking a novel, refreshing facet in their colorful fragrance journey.	f	published	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763710864915-219b71_9c4b1b483fd94389a261d983002ab098~mv2.png	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VYKE57F2G6J62R7CG5	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 07:51:09.738+00	\N	\N
prod_01KAJ873AJH7RBS5FNG773D1AA	ZESTY HAZE	zesty-haze-sorbe	HAZE	Zesty Haze Sorbet opens on a bracing, frosted citrus field - grapefruits and lemons sparkling like early sunlight. Imagine gently squeezing a fresh orange segment: the essential oils mist into the air with crystalline clarity, both cooling and awakening the senses. Zesty Haze Sorbet bottles that precise moment on skin, setting the tone for a day that begins alert and refreshed.\n\nTrue to the citrus family-bright, vivid, luminous, and clean-Zesty Haze Sorbet doesn’t fizzle out like many classic citrus colognes. A velvety musky base anchors the composition, giving it excellent longevity on skin. As it interacts with your body, the diffusion flexes with temperature-sometimes intimate, sometimes more expansive.\n\nAn ideal choice to kick-start a high-energy morning, power you through a workout, or refresh you anytime you crave a cool pocket of air in the tropical heat.	f	published	https://bykira-admin.mooo.com/static/1763711239101-219b71_b338cb78b412407a901e5c15e2193689~mv2.png	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	pcol_01KAJ872VYKE57F2G6J62R7CG5	\N	t	\N	2025-11-21 03:44:36.208+00	2025-11-21 07:50:48.285+00	\N	\N
