A", "unit_price": 1190000, "updated_at": "2025-12-08T07:41:30.465Z", "variant_id": "variant_01KAJ873NXAM205TBKS3NY3ZMK", "adjustments": [], "is_giftcard": false, "variant_sku": null, "product_type": null, "raw_subtotal": {"value": "2380000", "precision": 20}, "product_title": "ZESTY HAZE", "raw_tax_total": {"value": "0", "precision": 20}, "variant_title": "Main", "discount_total": 0, "original_total": 2380000, "product_handle": "zesty-haze-sorbe", "raw_unit_price": {"value": "1190000", "precision": 20}, "is_custom_price": false, "is_discountable": true, "product_type_id": null, "variant_barcode": null, "is_tax_inclusive": false, "product_subtitle": "HAZE", "discount_subtotal": 0, "original_subtotal": 2380000, "requires_shipping": true, "discount_tax_total": 0, "original_tax_total": 0, "product_collection": "Icy", "raw_discount_total": {"value": "0", "precision": 20}, "raw_original_total": {"value": "2380000", "precision": 20}, "product_description": "Zesty Haze Sorbet opens on a bracing, frosted citrus field - grapefruits and lemons sparkling like early sunlight. Imagine gently squeezing a fresh orange segment: the essential oils mist into the air with crystalline clarity, both cooling and awakening the senses. Zesty Haze Sorbet bottles that precise moment on skin, setting the tone for a day that begins alert and refreshed.\\n\\nTrue to the citrus family-bright, vivid, luminous, and clean-Zesty Haze Sorbet doesn’t fizzle out like many classic citrus colognes. A velvety musky base anchors the composition, giving it excellent longevity on skin. As it interacts with your body, the diffusion flexes with temperature-sometimes intimate, sometimes more expansive.\\n\\nAn ideal choice to kick-start a high-energy morning, power you through a workout, or refresh you anytime you crave a cool pocket of air in the tropical heat.", "compare_at_unit_price": null, "raw_discount_subtotal": {"value": "0", "precision": 20}, "raw_original_subtotal": {"value": "2380000", "precision": 20